{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1087332-how-would-it-work","id":1087332,"title":"How would it work","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-03T14:05:23-07:00","id":1087332,"title":"How would it work","content":"Let's say my mage creates a kinetic barrier around himself and locks it onto himself with life 3 so it moves with him.<br /> Now until he's punched or anything of that sort, it's coincidental. But once he's punched and it basically stops anything mid-air it becomes vulgar, then he would get 1 paradox.<br /> Question is, do i get only 1 paradox in total or do I keep on getting +1 paradox each time that the barrier blocks something midair?<br /> <br /> (IMO it would accumulate paradox with each attack that's being blocked, however im unsure and it'd be great if someone could confirm it.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12376-mowtekpvp","name":"MowtekPvP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T15:12:30-07:00","id":1087351,"title":"","content":"I wrote an answer regarding that topic <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1080603-mages-and-soak-damage?p=1081097#post1081097\">here.</a><br /> <br /> Hope it helps!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T15:14:19-07:00","id":1087352,"title":"","content":"I'd rule that barriers like this are a vulgar effect, give them a single point of paradox, and be done with it.<br /> <br /> The only way it would be coincidental is if you put the effect on a shield or something, so the outside observer would just think &quot;oh, the punch stopped because it hit the guys shield&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":12193,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","user":"Saikou","date":". 05-03-2017, 06:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T16:16:09-07:00","id":1087383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1087332-how-would-it-work?p=1087351#post1087351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wrote an answer regarding that topic <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1080603-mages-and-soak-damage?p=1081097#post1081097\">here.</a><br /> <br /> Hope it helps!</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1087332-how-would-it-work?p=1087352#post1087352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd rule that barriers like this are a vulgar effect, give them a single point of paradox, and be done with it.<br /> <br /> The only way it would be coincidental is if you put the effect on a shield or something, so the outside observer would just think &quot;oh, the punch stopped because it hit the guys shield&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! That helped a lot.<br /> I've another question, though.<br /> With prime 3 and life 3, I can enchant myself to deal and soak aggravated damage. If I make that permanent, would it come with perm paradox/pattern bleeding just like with the physical modifications?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12376-mowtekpvp","name":"MowtekPvP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T16:33:05-07:00","id":1087389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1087332-how-would-it-work?p=1087352#post1087352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd rule that barriers like this are a vulgar effect, give them a single point of paradox, and be done with it.<br /> <br /> The only way it would be coincidental is if you put the effect on a shield or something, so the outside observer would just think &quot;oh, the punch stopped because it hit the guys shield&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or if the Effect doesn't bounce attacks off, but diverts <i>around</i> the mage. If a guy throws a punch but he ends up hitting nothing but air, it could just be that he missed. Especially if the target is also visibly trying to evade.<br /> <br /> Mechanically, you could cause the shield to subtract successes from efforts to hit the target, at a one-to-one basis. Even if the shot hits, it wouldn't hit as well, and thus do less damage.<br /> <br /> Another way it could be coincidental - at least with hand-to-hand - is if the mage with the shield on looks like a tough bastard. If the opponent hits him in the chest and the mage doesn't even flinch, it could work if the mage looks sufficiently hardy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T18:06:23-07:00","id":1087434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MowtekPvP</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1087332-how-would-it-work?p=1087383#post1087383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks! That helped a lot.<br /> I've another question, though.<br /> With prime 3 and life 3, I can enchant myself to deal and soak aggravated damage. If I make that permanent, would it come with perm paradox/pattern bleeding just like with the physical modifications?</div> </div> </div> </div>You certainly could, though it wold definetly give you permanent paradox, possible one point for every point you put into soaking agg damage.<br /> <br /> If it was made permanent, as in a part of your life pattern, you wouldn't get any pattern bleed. Though that permenant paradox would become truly permanent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T02:34:35-07:00","id":1087587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1087332-how-would-it-work?p=1087434#post1087434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You certainly could, though it wold definetly give you permanent paradox, possible one point for every point you put into soaking agg damage.<br /> <br /> If it was made permanent, as in a part of your life pattern, you wouldn't get any pattern bleed. Though that permenant paradox would become truly permanent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alright. One more question.<br /> Slipstream - it specifies in the book that its effect remains coincidental so long as you don't overdo it.<br /> But then again, what do they mean by overdoing it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12376-mowtekpvp","name":"MowtekPvP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T03:05:28-07:00","id":1087595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MowtekPvP</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1087332-how-would-it-work?p=1087587#post1087587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright. One more question.<br /> Slipstream - it specifies in the book that its effect remains coincidental so long as you don't overdo it.<br /> But then again, what do they mean by overdoing it?</div> </div> </div> </div>How fast are we talking here?<br /> <br /> Going up to 16 mph or 160 mph ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T03:08:02-07:00","id":1087596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1087332-how-would-it-work?p=1087595#post1087595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How fast are we talking here?<br /> <br /> Going up to 16 mph or 160 mph ?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not about speed. <a href=\"https://gyazo.com/65f01038c63b55f738ee685d8e4c8065\" target=\"_blank\">https://gyazo.com/65f01038c63b55f738ee685d8e4c8065</a><br /> It's about messing with the attacker's perception and the likes. Therefore to anyone else it'd just look as if I'm simply good at dodging.<br /> However when would it begin to be vulgar?<br /> My mage personally would use the Corresp/Forces version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12376-mowtekpvp","name":"MowtekPvP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-04T03:27:09-07:00","id":1087599,"title":"","content":"Wow that effect is really general. RAW. I'm surprised it doesn't allow Mind 1 or 2 for being able to tell exactly when the opponent intends to hit and moving out of the way.<br /> <br /> Here's how I'd rule it. The effect needs 3 success to pull of, one per target, and successes in duration to ensure it lasts longer than a few seconds.<br /> <br /> to give your opponents a plus 2 to diff you'd need 6 successes as well as duration and target splits, and 9 successes for a plus 3.<br /> <br /> If ever you get 10 successes, the effect becomes vulgar and further rolls to build increase in difficulty to reflect this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}